rog-helper for Debian-family systems
===================================

This package installs:

- /usr/bin/rog-helper-ui
- /usr/bin/rog-helperd
- /usr/bin/rog-helper
- a desktop launcher and hicolor icon assets
- AppStream metadata
- a session D-Bus activation file for io.github.roghelper.Daemon
- a systemd --user unit at /usr/lib/systemd/user/rog-helperd.service

The desktop app can activate the daemon over the session bus on demand, so the
package works without enabling the user unit first.

To keep the daemon running across your desktop session, enable the user unit:

  systemctl --user daemon-reload
  systemctl --user enable --now rog-helperd.service

If you remove the package after enabling the user unit, refresh your current
session so systemd drops the removed unit file:

  systemctl --user daemon-reload
